From 2e66980a38d9ba7eb3c952b442ff48b6b2a68f78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dlssg-to-xefg <dev@local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:58:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add 5 XeFG fixes from reference mods plus 3 baseline
 hardening fixes

1. XeFG fixes learned from dlssg-0.4.2, f5low-kit, and DLSSG-MFG v3.0.1 (FrameGenerator.cpp):
   - Refuse unsupported backbuffer/output formats (e.g. scRGB FP16 R16G16B16A16_FLOAT)
     before XeFG::Init / Vulkan warmup instead of failing context creation.
   - Guard against HUD-less size/format/MSAA mismatch with backbuffer, falling back
     cleanly to XEFGD_UI_MODE_AUTO with a one-shot warning.
   - Clamp subrects to resource bounds and auto-reset XeFG history on DRS/subrect changes
     between consecutive frames even when the game omits DLSSG.Reset.
   - Sanitize NaN/Inf in camera vectors, view/projection matrices, jitter, and MV scale.
   - Respect DLSSG.OutputDisableInterpolation by copying the real frame cleanly.

2. Baseline hardening fixes (cuda_route.cpp, FrameGenerator.cpp, VulkanHost.cpp, stubs/Windows.h):
   - Add gCacheEpoch + heap GPU/CPU/descriptor-count validation to CUDA PersistentHeapCache.
   - Add explicit #include <algorithm> in FrameGenerator.cpp.
   - Query active foreground monitor Hz in VulkanHost::QueryDisplayRefreshHz() for multi-monitor AutoVrrPacing.
